AltoMarket::setBorrowOpeningFee
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── it should update borrowOpeningFee
    ├── it should emit SetBorrowOpeningFee event
    ├── when borrowOpeningFee is greater than MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when fee recipient is not set borrowOpeningFee is greater than 0
        └── it should revert